# Secrets — never commit real Supabase keys.
# Config/Debug.xcconfig and Config/Release.xcconfig ARE committed with
# placeholder values only; if you replace the placeholders with real
# secret/service-role keys locally, keep that change out of version control.
*.xcconfig.local
